!   Array composed of twelve Photowatt PW-1000 (95W/24V) mc-Si modules.
!   Modules use 24-V option and are wired in parallel. Photo shows
!   application in SP1200 stand-alone hybrid system integrated by
!   Sacred Power Corporation, Albuquerque, NM.
!   2001
!   mc-Si
! The objects and syntax in this dataset comply with EnergyPlus, Version 8.4.0 and above, unless otherwise noted.

